'''Jatiel West railway station''' ({{Langx|mxi|خَاتِيِيلْ إِسْتَاثِيُونْ وُإِيسْتِي|H̱atiel Estazióń Oéste}}) is a major through [[W:Train station|station]] recently completed in the [[Arrabád, Jatiel|Arrabád]] barrio of [[Jatiel]], [[Luzamontaña]]. It is intended to serve as the primary station for northern and western Jatiel, relieving strain at [[Jatiel Central station]]. 

It is built to be a major public transport hub, with dedicated stations on [[Jatiel Metro]] lines [[Line 1 (Jatiel Metro)|1]], [[Line 4 (Jatiel Metro)|4]] and [[Line 8 (Jatiel Metro)|8]], as well as a [[W:Bus station|bus station]]. The complex is one of the largest in Balisca, incorporating a sprawling [[W:Food hall|food hall]], capsule hotels, a movie theater, a [[W:Don Quijote (store)|Don Quijote]] store, and several local government facilities under one roof. 

